    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Supplement Store Theme offers a structured layout for presenting products, organizing categories, and displaying essential store information. A Supplement Store can use customizable product sections to show images, descriptions, prices, and product details. The homepage can feature selected items, promotional banners, and links to relevant collections. Navigation menus help visitors browse the catalog and locate products efficiently. Design settings allow adjustments to colors, typography, and page elements to maintain a consistent visual identity. The layout can accommodate a Nutrition Store with clearly organized product categories and informative product pages. A Health Supplement Brand can use dedicated sections to present product details and brand information. A Vitamin Store may organize items by category, while a Protein Powder Store can display product variations and descriptions. The design can also support a Sports Nutrition Brand that needs structured product listings. A Fitness Supplement Shop can customize homepage sections and navigation to suit its catalog. Responsive layouts help maintain usability across desktop and mobile devices, while e-commerce functionality may require compatible plugins."
    },
